  "content": "\n\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/958291/description_31da0c1a-3425-4a56-b9ff-8795113b90fd.png\" alt=\"Crate Delight\"></p>\n<p><strong>使用木箱與袋子擴展您的物品儲存空間！</strong> Crate Delight 讓您可以製作木箱與袋子，以時尚的方式整理資源，保持箱子整潔無雜物，並讓背包井然有序。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/crate-delight-forge/files/all?page=1&pageSize=20&version=26.1&showAlphaFiles=hide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ZmYDVgW.png\" alt=\"下載 26.1 更新\"></a><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/KXy6vrX.png\" alt=\"Fabric 版本下載\"></p>\n<h2>🍎 功能特色</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>木箱：</strong>存放蘋果、甜莓、雞蛋、生鮭魚、生鱈魚、螢光莓、金蘋果等眾多物品！</li>\n<li><strong>袋子：</strong>適用於可可豆、砂糖、火藥等其他物品。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>🛠️ 擴充模組</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/crate-delight-croptopia\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Crate Delight：Croptopia</a>&nbsp;\n<ul>\n<li>為 Croptopia 新增超過 50 種新木箱與袋子。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpaypal.me%252fkevgelhorn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/9rlXSyLg/images/491c87c96cd602ec45774ce0b0cb9fe4d25ba074.png\" alt=\"正在存錢買筆電！\" width=\"1150\" height=\"227\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Axperty\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/intergrav/devins-badges/refs/heads/v3/assets/cozy/donate/patreon-singular_64h.png\" alt=\"支持我\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpaypal.me%252fkevgelhorn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/intergrav/devins-badges/refs/heads/v3/assets/cozy/donate/paypal-singular_64h.png\" alt=\"贊助我\"></a></p>",
